    "description_en": "The bayanat-norm-v1 policy of arabic-normalize (alef variants to bare alef, alef maqsura to yeh, taa marbuta kept, digits to ASCII, diacritics and tatweel removed) with three changes for word scoring: punctuation replaced by spaces, white space collapsed, Latin lowercased.",
